+A figure with nothing to measure reads "Not measured", never zero. The same figures are in `status/usage.json` under `outcomes`, and `python3 -m anvil.cli metrics .` prints them as JSON. They describe the runs on record: a repository that keeps only its approved runs will read 100 percent. Spec: `.openspec/specs/outcome-metrics/spec.md`.
+
